                "text": "I pushed CMS to expand PrEP coverage under Medicare \u2014 and now it\u2019s happening.\n\nNo more out-of-pocket costs for these life-saving medications.\n\nThis is a huge step forward in the fight against HIV, ensuring access for all Medicare enrollees who need it.",
