                "text": "RFK Jr. will not make America healthy again.\n\nBut his ignorance may make people sick again.\nDeprive them of the treatment they need again.\nCause hospitals to close again.\n\nWe have to vote like our lives depend on it. Because for many Americans \u2013 it will. https://t.co/yuI5PwxNdy",
