                "text": "At number 3 - Stripping away healthcare for millions of Americans.\n\nEveryone, Medicaid recipient or not, will feel the effects of these senseless cuts when hospitals close, clinics close, and your medical bills go up. https://t.co/t1YYbDFsDI",
