                "text": "When Republicans cut Medicaid, they cut funding to hospitals.\n\nWhen they cut hospital funding, they cut critical hospital staff.\n\nWhen they cut hospital staff, it puts lives at risk.\n\nJust another consequence of the GOP's Big Ugly Bill. https://t.co/Nk27IOhZWb",
