                "text": "The recent closure of Glenn Medical Center in Willows, CA is devastating and could put lives at risk.  \n \nI'm introducing a new, bipartisan bill to restore funding to hospitals like this one in the hope that Glenn Medical Center can reopen, so California families don't lose access to life-saving care in any part of our state.",
