                "text": "Millions of hardworking people are already struggling with higher costs in Donald Trump\u2019s economy. \u00a0\n\u00a0\nBut Republicans are doubling down on his agenda of increased health care premiums, higher utility bills and his tariff tax on consumer goods.\n\nIt\u2019s time for Trump to live up to his promise to lower prices. He can start by reopening the government.",
